{{Term/Store|Farosh's Claw|Farosh's Claws|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Farosh's Claw}}<br/>This claw was plucked from the golden spirit Farosh. Its electricity was expelled before it was removed, so it's safe to handle. A store will buy it, but it must have some other use.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Farosh's Claw}}<br/>A valuable claw that once produced lightning. Attach it to a weapon to greatly increase its attack power. It can also be cooked or sold for rupees.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Farosh's Claws originate from [[Farosh]], no longer containing its [[Electricity]] powers.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Farosh can be found flying through [[Lake Hylia]], [[Lake Floria]], or the [[Gerudo Highlands]]. When [[Link]] shoots at Farosh's hands with an [[Arrow]], the Claw will be surrounded by light and fall to the ground onearby.

When used in [[Cooking]], Farosh's Claws will always result in [[Dubious Food]]. However, if they are Cooked with critters, the result will be an [[Elixir]]. They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] as an ingredient for [[Light Yellow Dye]].

Farosh's Claws are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Farosh's Claw}}

